THIRD-PARTY LICENSES
====================

The ranikust binary is linked statically: it contains the code of every
crate listed below, ranikust's own included, and the C code that some of
them compile into it. This file was generated by cargo-about from
Cargo.lock for the target x86_64-unknown-linux-musl; dependencies used only
by build scripts or tests are not in the binary and not listed. The last
section, "Toolchain components", covers what the Rust toolchain links in:
the standard library, musl libc and LLVM's libunwind.

